@cryptos-pki/ui (vendored)

This is a vendored copy of packages/ui from CryptOS-PKI/cryptos-web, at commit
6720003 (feat(dev): a development-only Copy for UI issue button, #167).

It is copied in, not installed from a registry, because cryptos-web does not
publish this package. It is not kept in lockstep with cryptos-web automatically;
re-copy it from that commit (or a later one) by hand when the website needs a
newer version of the kit, and update the commit noted above.

